  "message": {
    "role": "system",
    "content": "实验环境上下文（程序显式提供并单独记录，不改写用户输入）：\n{\"experimentMode\":\"continuous\",\"tokenDecimals\":6,\"amountValidation\":\"fixed_task\",\"units\":\"所有写入工具的amount、amountIn、minAmountOut只接受人类可读的十进制代币数量字符串；不要乘代币精度，也不要直接填入链状态中的整数。转换只由钱包适配器执行一次。优先读取formatted中的代币数量，原始balances、allowances、shares和get_balance.balance保留整数最小单位供核验。\",\"examples\":[{\"requested\":\"20 TokenA\",\"toolArgument\":{\"amount\":\"20\"}},{\"requested\":\"0.5 TokenB\",\"toolArgument\":{\"amount\":\"0.5\"}}],\"taskParameters\":{\"amountIn\":\"10\",\"minAmountOut\":\"9\"},\"fixedTaskTargetsInTokens\":{\"swap\":{\"amountIn\":\"10\",\"minAmountOut\":\"9\"},\"approve_token_if_needed\":{\"token\":\"A\",\"spender\":\"amm\",\"amount\":\"10\"}},\"targetPolicy\":\"本次任务规格由记录的taskParameters确定；工具金额校验、脚本基线与独立检查器使用同一规格。fixed_task策略在执行前校验这些目标金额；schema_only仅校验格式，用于研究错误行为。TokenA/TokenB及收款账户保持所选实验模板。\",\"initialStateFormatted\":{\"unit\":\"token\",\"tokenDecimals\":6,\"nativeDecimals\":18,\"balances\":{\"agentA\":\"100\",\"agentB\":\"0\",\"recipientA\":\"0\",\"recipientB\":\"0\",\"native\":\"10\"},\"allowances\":{\"ammA\":\"0\",\"vaultB\":\"0\"},\"reserves\":{\"A\":\"10000\",\"B\":\"10000\"},\"shares\":\"0\",\"vaultAssets\":\"0\"},\"initialState\":{\"chainInstanceId\":\"d065f717-0cbe-4edb-b8ee-c68a017c7982\",\"chainId\":31337,\"blockNumber\":\"7\",\"blockHash\":\"0x9800098d76fe166463987b88370128ca6856e3c9299597444a74e75cdb183f6a\",\"timestamp\":\"1700000007\",\"addresses\":{\"agent\":\"0x70997970C51812dc3A010C7d01b50e0d17dc79C8\",\"recipient\":\"0x3C44CdDdB6a900fa2b585dd299e03d12FA4293BC\",\"tokenA\":\"0x5fbdb2315678afecb367f032d93f642f64180aa3\",\"tokenB\":\"0xe7f1725e7734ce288f8367e1bb143e90bb3f0512\",\"amm\":\"0x9fe46736679d2d9a65f0992f2272de9f3c7fa6e0\",\"vault\":\"0xcf7ed3acca5a467e9e704c703e8d87f634fb0fc9\"},\"balances\":{\"agentA\":\"100000000\",\"agentB\":\"0\",\"recipientA\":\"0\",\"recipientB\":\"0\",\"native\":\"10000000000000000000\"},\"allowances\":{\"ammA\":\"0\",\"vaultB\":\"0\"},\"shares\":\"0\",\"vaultAssets\":\"0\",\"reserves\":{\"A\":\"10000000000\",\"B\":\"10000000000\"},\"nonce\":0,\"formatted\":{\"unit\":\"token\",\"tokenDecimals\":6,\"nativeDecimals\":18,\"balances\":{\"agentA\":\"100\",\"agentB\":\"0\",\"recipientA\":\"0\",\"recipientB\":\"0\",\"native\":\"10\"},\"allowances\":{\"ammA\":\"0\",\"vaultB\":\"0\"},\"reserves\":{\"A\":\"10000\",\"B\":\"10000\"},\"shares\":\"0\",\"vaultAssets\":\"0\"}},\"scope\":\"本次目标相对本次initialState判定。兑换后存入仅存本次兑换新增的TokenB，保留本次运行前已有的TokenB及份额。\"}"
  },
  "source": "run_initial_state_and_unit_contract",
  "userInputUnchanged": true
}

